# Spec Platform — INDEX

> Reading paths for humans, developers, and AI agents.

## Who reads what first

| You are... | Start here | Then... |
|------------|-----------|---------|
| New team member | SPEC.dog (5 min) | constitution.dog → plan.dog |
| Developer | SPEC.dog | data-model.dog → plan.dog |
| AI agent | data-model.dog | COPY.dog → DESIGN-SYSTEM.dog → SPEC.dog |
| Designer | DESIGN-SYSTEM.dog | SPEC.dog → COPY.dog |
| Investor / stakeholder | SPEC.dog | plan.dog |

## Human reading path (5 min)

```
SPEC.dog              ← What does it do? Screens, flows, stories.
constitution.dog      ← Immutable rules. What can't change.
plan.dog              ← Execution phases. What's next.
```

## AI agent reading path

```
data-model.dog        ← Exact types. Graph ontology. Query patterns.
COPY.dog              ← Every string. Every state. No guessing.
DESIGN-SYSTEM.dog     ← Every token. Every component. Every screen layout.
SPEC.dog              ← Product context. User stories. Success criteria.
constitution.dog      ← Constraints to enforce.
plan.dog              ← What to build next.
```

## Execution path

```
INDEX.dog (here)
  → SPEC.dog              Product, screens, flows
  → constitution.dog      Rules, constraints, governance
  → data-model.dog        Entities, relationships, vectors, predictions
  → COPY.dog              Every UI string
  → DESIGN-SYSTEM.dog     Tokens → primitives → components → patterns → screens
  → plan.dog              Phases 0-6, repo layout, verification steps
```

